--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party corpus samples
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The injection test corpus under tests/corpus/attacks/ carries capped,
seed-fixed samples from three MIT-licensed datasets. The benign counter-corpus
under tests/corpus/benign/ carries a fourth MIT-licensed dataset, NotInject,
and excerpts of CC-BY-4.0 arXiv papers (the next section after the MIT text).
Every sampled payload was re-rendered (as a search snippet, a page body or a
text upload, with every host rewritten to an RFC 2606 reserved name) by
scripts/corpus/ingest/. These records are test data only; none is shipped
in the image. Each record's `source` object names its dataset, licence,
revision and upstream row.

