--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party benign corpus text - CC-BY-4.0 arXiv papers
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `security_prose` genre under tests/corpus/benign/ carries excerpts of
papers on prompt injection whose arXiv abstract page states the licence
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Each record is the paper's abstract and one section, taken from the arXiv HTML
version pinned below. Changes were made: the text was excerpted, reflowed as a
web page, and every host it names was rewritten to an RFC 2606 reserved name
by scripts/corpus/ingest/. Nothing here implies that the authors endorse this
project. The authors are named as the paper states them.

